files and analysis code in this repository.

It does NOT apply to the underlying text of Le Mirouer des simples âmes
anienties. The work itself (c. 1290-1300) is in the public domain. The base
transcription is taken from Wikisource (Chantilly manuscript, Musée Condé);
consult the Wikisource page for the terms covering the transcription before
redistributing corpus/mirouer_corpus_clean.txt.

